            "description": "# RecoLul\n\n## Installation\n\n```\npip install recolul\nrecolul config\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n### Overtime balance\n\n```shell\n$ recolul balance\nMonthly overtime balance: 00:51\n\nLast day 2/6(\u6708)\n  Clock-in: 09:10\n  Working hours: 07:19\n  Break: 01:00\n```\n\n### Overtime balance graph\n\n```shell\n$ recolul graph\n```\n\n![Overtime balance graph](./doc/graph_example.png)\n\n### When to leave\n\n```shell\n$ recolul when\nLeave today at 17:43 to avoid overtime (includes a 1-hour break).\n```\n\n## Config\n\n### Environment variables\n\n- `RECORU_AUTH_ID`\n- `RECORU_CONTRACT_ID`\n- `RECORU_PASSWORD`\n\n### Config file\n\n```\nrecolul config\n```\n\n## Build\n\n```\npython -m build\n```\n",
